{"event": "turn", "session_id": "1e6b4abec4684d6d9a1c506eb32ce3bb", "sequence": 1, "created_at": "2026-10-16T07:30:36.383040+00:00", "message": "比较绿茶和白茶的区别", "resolved_question": "比较绿茶和白茶的区别", "context_turns": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "disabled", "config_revision": 3, "compliance_blocked": false, "elapsed_seconds": 15.369, "model_calls": 3, "input_tokens": 5831, "output_tokens": 801, "response": {"answer": "**绿茶与白茶的区别（依据本次检索到的资料）**\n\n1. **加工工艺不同**\n- 绿茶：对鲜叶快速加热以钝化酶，随后可能经过揉捻、做形或粉碎、干燥等步骤；其定义性特点是**不经过红茶那种刻意氧化/发酵**（来源：ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types）。\n- 白茶：按 ISO 20715 的描述，是采摘的茶芽经**萎凋和干燥**两个阶段制成（来源：ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types）。\n\n2. **氧化程度不同**\n- 绿茶：**很少或没有刻意氧化**（来源：Fermentation: The Key Step in Processing of Black Tea）。\n- 白茶：本次证据只说明其萎凋、干燥工艺，**未直接给出白茶的氧化程度数值**，无法据此量化比较。\n\n3. **概念层面**\n- 绿茶、白茶都属于“加工产品类型”，与“茶树品种（cultivar）”是不同概念；同一品种用不同典型工艺加工，可得到不同的化学成分特征（来源：Impact of Six Typical Processing Methods on the Chemical Composition of Tea Leaves）。\n\n**无法验证的部分**\n- 本次证据未提供绿茶与白茶在**风味、香气、咖啡因含量、适宜人群、冲泡方法**等方面的对比，这些属性无法验证，不作编造。\n- 未检索到两者**价格、库存**相关数据。\n\n如需进一步比较风味或选购建议，请告诉我您更关注哪一方面。", "intent": "question_answering", "intents": ["question_answering"], "confidence": null, "intent_source": "rules", "recommendations": [], "knowledge_sources": [{"title": "ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types", "url": "https://www.iso.org/obp/ui?_escaped_fragment_=iso%3Astd%3Aiso%3A20715%3Aed-1%3Av1%3Aen", "year": null}, {"title": "Fermentation: The Key Step in Processing of Black Tea", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/fr/records/6473b0a3542a3f9f03b31231", "year": null}, {"title": "Impact of Six Typical Processing Methods on the Chemical Composition of Tea Leaves", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/en/records/65dff5d763b8185d9cb04493", "year": null}, {"title": "Tea Board India — Modalities and Scheme Guidelines", "url": "https://www.teaboard.gov.in/pdf/schemes/Modalities_and_scheme_guidelines_12th_Plan.pdf", "year": null}], "memory_used": false, "clarification_required": false, "tasks": [{"id": "s1", "tool": "introduce_tea", "status": "success"}], "task_plan": {"steps": [{"id": "s1", "intent": "question_answering", "tool": "introduce_tea", "request": "比较绿茶和白茶的区别", "depends_on": [], "product_from": null, "limit": 4, "recommendation": null, "knowledge_from": null, "tea_scope": []}], "output_order": ["s1"], "source": "rules"}, "unmet_requirements": [], "diagnostics": [], "compliance_blocked": false, "explained_categories": [], "pii_redacted": false}, "retrieval": [{"original_query": "比较绿茶和白茶的区别", "rewrite_status": ["translated"], "rewrite_error_types": [], "rejected_variants": 0, "queries": [{"round": 0, "query": "比较绿茶和白茶的区别", "limit": 15, "hits": 15, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "Compare the differences between green tea and white tea", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "比较绿茶和白茶的区别 | green tea white tea", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "绿茶与白茶有何不同", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}], "rerank_status": ["success"], "retry": false, "retry_adopted": false, "retry_reasons": [], "selected_ids": ["65", "66", "81", "78", "79"], "remaining_issues": [], "missing_subjects": []}]}
